PLACEHOLDER — replace this file with your device certificate.

Copy the PEM produced by samples/common/scripts/Initialize-SuSampleEnvironment.ps1
(su-sim-device-cert.pem) here, or generate your own X.509 client certificate
whose CN matches CONFIG_SU_DPS_REGISTRATION_ID. The contents must be a single
PEM block:

-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----
...base64...
-----END CERTIFICATE-----
